WEBVTT

1
00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.120
I received your letter!

2
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.210
Number two!

3
00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.890
I bet everyone has their own love fantasies.

4
00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.810
But maybe not one quite like mine.

5
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.490
Not when one of my crushes
shows up at my front door.

6
00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.520
I couldn't remember what
happened that night,

7
00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:54.140
but I must have done something to
make Raymond smile awkwardly at me.

8
00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.500
Theo, what's this?

9
00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.910
Something I should have given you.

10
00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:06.580
Number two.

11
00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:08.480
Don't fall in love with me, okay?
